    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:100e6762bde64d7597cad24f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然艾尼斯风神如此照顾我，\r\n但身为她的训练员，我还是应该好好地帮助她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b83ce24f3c2973662f67010614b876292e611b6e67c3ed79f1bc8ac5cf5ad971",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
